  "welcomeSlide1Title": "Keep your own mind sharp",
  "@welcomeSlide1Title": {
    "description": "One slide of the welcome carousel: the premise — why reasoning is the thing worth practising."
  },
  "welcomeSlide1Body": "AI can write the code now. It can't sit in the interview for you, or explain why you chose this over that. Ten minutes a day keeps that muscle yours.",
  "@welcomeSlide1Body": {
    "description": "One slide of the welcome carousel: body."
  },
  "welcomeSlide2Title": "Say it out loud",
  "@welcomeSlide2Title": {
    "description": "One slide of the welcome carousel: the shape of the product."
  },
  "welcomeSlide2Body": "Tap the mic and talk through your idea the way you would to a colleague. Messy is fine. No code, no typing, no multiple choice.",
  "@welcomeSlide2Body": {
    "description": "One slide of the welcome carousel: body."
  },
  "welcomeSlide3Title": "One problem a day",
  "@welcomeSlide3Title": {
    "description": "One slide of the welcome carousel: why the tutor is Socratic."
  },
  "welcomeSlide3Body": "No feed. No backlog to fall behind on. One problem, a few minutes, done.",
  "@welcomeSlide3Body": {
    "description": "One slide of the welcome carousel: body."
  },
  "welcomeSlide4Title": "It asks. It never tells.",
  "@welcomeSlide4Title": {
    "description": "One slide of the welcome carousel: the assessment is learner-triggered."
  },
  "welcomeSlide4Body": "The tutor pushes back instead of answering. That's the point, and yes, it can feel stubborn. Stuck? Tap Hint or Example. Neither costs you a turn.",
  "@welcomeSlide4Body": {
    "description": "One slide of the welcome carousel: body."
  },
  "welcomeSlide5Title": "You say when you are done",
  "@welcomeSlide5Title": {
    "description": "One slide of the welcome carousel: the daily reminder, enabled inline."
  },
  "welcomeSlide5Body": "It'll keep asking forever if you let it. Tap Finish when you've said your piece. That's what gets you the write-up.",
  "@welcomeSlide5Body": {
    "description": "One slide of the welcome carousel: body."
  },
  "welcomeSlide6Title": "Make it a habit",
  "@welcomeSlide6Title": {
    "description": "One slide of the welcome carousel: the BYOK model."
  },
  "welcomeSlide6Body": "A new problem lands every day. Pick a time and we'll nudge you: one reminder, made on this phone. Miss a day and the streak just starts again.",
  "@welcomeSlide6Body": {
    "description": "One slide of the welcome carousel: body."
  },
  "welcomeSlide7Title": "Free to use",
  "@welcomeSlide7Title": {
    "description": "One slide of the welcome carousel: what the share card carries."
  },
  "welcomeSlide7Body": "Start with sessions on us. After that, paste a free API key. Groq and Google both give one away, no card. It stays on this phone.",
  "@welcomeSlide7Body": {
    "description": "One slide of the welcome carousel: body."
  },
